OL,3,AThis actor was told he had Alzheimer's,
OL,4,Anow he's performing a one-man show
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn camera he was the adviser to the US
OL,7,Fpresident in Love Actually and one of
OL,8,Fthe airline passengers in the drama
OL,9,FUnited 93.
